WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,990
This is my confidence, Qin Tian

2
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:15,990
This is Jinshan, Aunt Wang and Aunt Li

3
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:16,990
I'll wander around the mountains

4
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:19,090
I heard that you joined a machine factory as a worker

5
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:20,090
true or false

6
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:22,090
Just temporary workers

7
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,090
buyer

8
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:24,090
Get some mountain goods for the factory

9
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:26,090
Temporary workers are also workers

10
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:28,090
Are you eating commercial food?

11
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:29,090
You are nineteen

12
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,090
It’s time to talk about my wife

13
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:31,090
The homestead has been approved

14
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:33,090
Build a house just for weddings

15
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:35,090
Shens

16
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:36,860
I just stood up

17
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:41,460
Don't worry, Brother Tian

18
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,520
Do you have a girl you like now?

19
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:48,820
I want to live a stable life first

20
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:49,820
Brother Qin

21
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:56,540
Come to Jinshan and take me with you.

22
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:57,540
I know the way

23
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:58,540
Don't cause trouble
